{
  "id": "ss.lib.face",
  "name": "Survivor face",
  "description": "The face every survivor wears — two big eyes with a glint in each, blush on both cheeks and a small mouth — drawn for a head of radius nine facing +x, so the near eye is the larger and the far one sits back toward the ear. The hive has no eyes because it never needed them; it reads the world by scent. A survivor whose organ has gone dead has nothing left to read with, and this is what grew in its place: the one face on the field, and the reason the eight are the eight and not the hive. Composed into every `ss.char.*` at the head's centre. The variants are expressions, one per survivor, and they say what each one is like before the weapon does.",
